                         │
                         ▼
                  AI Response
                         │
             ┌───────────┴───────────┐
             │                       │
             ▼                       ▼
        Customer Response       CRM Intelligence
                                     │
                                     ▼
                                  Lead
                                     │
                              Interest Detection
                                     │
                                     ▼
                              Salesperson
                                     │
                                     ▼
                               Follow-up
```

# 13. Key Architectural Principles

### Principle 1 — Separate CRM Data and Vector Data

The primary database should manage business entities.

ChromaDB should manage embeddings and retrieval.

Do not use ChromaDB as the CRM database.

### Principle 2 — Backend Is the Gateway

React should communicate with Express.

Express should communicate with:

* Database
* RAG layer
* Cloudinary
* Socket.IO
* WhatsApp API

### Principle 3 — RAG Must Be Company-Aware

Every document/vector should be associated with the correct company/tenant.

### Principle 4 — AI Should Not Directly Control the Database

Use structured AI outputs/tools and backend validation before CRM mutations.

### Principle 5 — Build Internal Chat Before WhatsApp

This allows the complete AI workflow to be tested without external messaging API complexity.

### Principle 6 — Measure RAG Quality

A working chatbot is not automatically a good RAG system.

Retrieval quality and answer correctness should be evaluated with test questions before production deployment.

