# 14. Final Development Sequence

```text
PHASE 0
Architecture & Planning
        ↓
PHASE 1
Backend + Authentication
        ↓
PHASE 2
CRM Dashboard
        ↓
PHASE 3
Company/Product Knowledge
        ↓
PHASE 4
RAG Pipeline
        ↓
PHASE 5
RAG Agent API
        ↓
PHASE 6
Internal Chat
        ↓
PHASE 7
CRM + AI Integration
        ↓
PHASE 8
WhatsApp Integration
        ↓
PHASE 9
Testing + Security + Production
```

## Definition of Done

The project can be considered ready for its first real deployment when:

* Authentication is secure
* CRM workflows are functional
* Company documents can be uploaded
* Documents are correctly indexed
* RAG retrieves relevant information
* AI responses are grounded in company data
* Conversations are persisted
* Leads can be created/updated
* High-interest leads can reach salespeople
* Tenant/company data is isolated
* APIs are authenticated and validated
* Errors are handled
* RAG quality has been evaluated
* The system can be monitored in production

The **WhatsApp integration should be considered a channel expansion**, not the foundation of the product. The real core product is the combination of **CRM + company knowledge base + RAG agent + conversation intelligence**.
